<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Sunraysia half-yr net up 35.6 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Sunraysia half-yr net up 35.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended Dec 31</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  5.79 vs  5.06</p>
<p>    Net profit			  3.74 vs  2.76</p>
<p>    Sales				35.81 vs 35.05</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		   4.0 vs 4.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Sunraysia Television Ltd is a regional television broadcaster.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
